# Cashback / rebate — an ExactOdds casino rule pack.
#
# VIP cashback is a standing promise: lose X, get Y% back. When the rebate
# lands short, the argument is about whose spreadsheet is right. This program
# is the promise, published: net loss and rebate rate in, exact rebate in
# cents out. Winning periods pay nothing — cashback is a rebate on losses.
#
# Rules: rebate = net_loss * rebate_pct / 100, integer division floors. A
# net win or break-even (net_loss <= 0) rebates 0. No floats anywhere —
# floats can't be exact.

def cashback(net_loss_cents: int, rebate_pct: int) -> int do
    if net_loss_cents <= 0 do
        ret 0
    end
    ret net_loss_cents * rebate_pct / 100
end

# Audited cases.
say(cashback(10000, 10))
say(cashback(-5000, 10))
say(cashback(999, 15))
say(cashback(0, 10))
